{"id":"4a24e3f8bb40a4b5","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-string-topology.md","title":"Chas–Sullivan String Topology","display":"df-string-topology — Chas–Sullivan String Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-string-topology","aliases":["58-df-string-topology"],"display":"df-string-topology — Chas–Sullivan String Topology","depends_on":["[[58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold]]","[[../batch18/58-df-loop-space.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-homology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-string-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-string-topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-string-topology — Chas–Sullivan String Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec1809e41ec24c81\" href=\"?note=ec1809e41ec24c81\" title=\"58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold\">58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0f3f51ff44894234\" href=\"?note=0f3f51ff44894234\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-loop-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-loop-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9f6d19a1e737076\" href=\"?note=d9f6d19a1e737076\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-homology.md\">../batch08/58-df-homology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-string-topology-—-String-Topology\">df-string-topology — String Topology</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M)\">\\((M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M)\\)</span> (closed oriented smooth <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>-manifold with chosen oriented atlas), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"LM=C(S^1,M)\">\\(LM=C(S^1,M)\\)</span> (free-loop space), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (coefficient ring)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"SH=(SH_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\">\\(SH=(SH_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\)</span> (degree-shifted loop homology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star,\\Delta,\\beta\">\\(\\star,\\Delta,\\beta\\)</span> (loop product, BV operator, and derived bracket)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S\\)</span> (ambient manifold predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ec1809e41ec24c81\" href=\"?note=ec1809e41ec24c81\" title=\"58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold\">58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StringHomology}_S,\\mathrm{HomogeneousElement}_S,\\mathrm{ChasSullivanStringTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StringHomology}_S,\\mathrm{HomogeneousElement}_S,\\mathrm{ChasSullivanStringTopology}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}string\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{StringHomology}_S(SH,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d)\\land LM=C(S^1,M)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(SH_k=H_{k+d}(LM;R))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}string\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{StringHomology}_S(SH,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d)\\land LM=C(S^1,M)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(SH_k=H_{k+d}(LM;R))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}string\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{HomogeneousElement}_S(a,k,SH)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\mathbb Z\\land a\\in SH_k\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}string\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{HomogeneousElement}_S(a,k,SH)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\mathbb Z\\land a\\in SH_k\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}string\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChasSullivanStringTopology}_S(SH,\\star,\\Delta,\\beta,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{StringHomology}_S(SH,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d,R)\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\star:SH_p\\otimes_RSH_q\\to SH_{p+q})\\land\\forall p,q,r\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall a\\in SH_p\\;\\forall b\\in SH_q\\;\\forall c\\in SH_r\\;\\bigl((a\\star b)\\star c=a\\star(b\\star c)\\land a\\star b=(-1)^{pq}b\\star a\\bigr)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\Delta:SH_k\\to SH_{k+1})\\land\\Delta\\circ\\Delta=0\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall a\\in SH_p\\;\\forall b\\in SH_q\\;\\Bigl(\\beta(a,b)\\in SH_{p+q+1}\\land\\beta(a,b)=(-1)^p\\bigl(\\Delta(a\\star b)-\\Delta(a)\\star b-(-1)^p a\\star\\Delta(b)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall p,q,r\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall a\\in SH_p\\;\\forall b\\in SH_q\\;\\forall c\\in SH_r\\;\\bigl(\\beta(a,b\\star c)=\\beta(a,b)\\star c+(-1)^{(p+1)q}b\\star\\beta(a,c)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}string\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChasSullivanStringTopology}_S(SH,\\star,\\Delta,\\beta,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{StringHomology}_S(SH,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d,R)\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\star:SH_p\\otimes_RSH_q\\to SH_{p+q})\\land\\forall p,q,r\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall a\\in SH_p\\;\\forall b\\in SH_q\\;\\forall c\\in SH_r\\;\\bigl((a\\star b)\\star c=a\\star(b\\star c)\\land a\\star b=(-1)^{pq}b\\star a\\bigr)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\Delta:SH_k\\to SH_{k+1})\\land\\Delta\\circ\\Delta=0\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall a\\in SH_p\\;\\forall b\\in SH_q\\;\\Bigl(\\beta(a,b)\\in SH_{p+q+1}\\land\\beta(a,b)=(-1)^p\\bigl(\\Delta(a\\star b)-\\Delta(a)\\star b-(-1)^p a\\star\\Delta(b)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall p,q,r\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall a\\in SH_p\\;\\forall b\\in SH_q\\;\\forall c\\in SH_r\\;\\bigl(\\beta(a,b\\star c)=\\beta(a,b)\\star c+(-1)^{(p+1)q}b\\star\\beta(a,c)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>String topology defined by Chas–Sullivan (1999).</li>\n<li>The shift by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> makes the loop product degree <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>; on unshifted homology it has degree <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-d\">\\(-d\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The displayed BV identity determines the degree-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> Gerstenhaber bracket and its derivation rule.</li>\n<li>The bracket is now an argument of the structure predicate, and every sign uses an explicitly bound homogeneous degree; the zero element therefore causes no ambiguous notation such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|0|\">\\(|0|\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The topology and oriented atlas are explicit inputs, so the manifold premise now has a defined source and carries the orientation needed by the loop product.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-string-topology-—-String-Topology","text":"df-string-topology — String Topology","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"ec1809e41ec24c81","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-loop-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0f3f51ff44894234","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-loop-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-homology.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9f6d19a1e737076","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-homology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"ec1809e41ec24c81","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S$ (ambient manifold predicate, see [[58-df-closed-oriented-smooth-manifold]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M)","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"LM=C(S^1,M)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"SH=(SH_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}","display":false},{"tex":"\\star,\\Delta,\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StringHomology}_S,\\mathrm{HomogeneousElement}_S,\\mathrm{ChasSullivanStringTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}string\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{StringHomology}_S(SH,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ClosedOrientedSmoothManifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d)\\land LM=C(S^1,M)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(SH_k=H_{k+d}(LM;R))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}string\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{HomogeneousElement}_S(a,k,SH)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\mathbb Z\\land a\\in SH_k","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}string\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChasSullivanStringTopology}_S(SH,\\star,\\Delta,\\beta,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{StringHomology}_S(SH,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d,R)\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\star:SH_p\\otimes_RSH_q\\to SH_{p+q})\\land\\forall p,q,r\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall a\\in SH_p\\;\\forall b\\in SH_q\\;\\forall c\\in SH_r\\;\\bigl((a\\star b)\\star c=a\\star(b\\star c)\\land a\\star b=(-1)^{pq}b\\star a\\bigr)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\Delta:SH_k\\to SH_{k+1})\\land\\Delta\\circ\\Delta=0\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall a\\in SH_p\\;\\forall b\\in SH_q\\;\\Bigl(\\beta(a,b)\\in SH_{p+q+1}\\land\\beta(a,b)=(-1)^p\\bigl(\\Delta(a\\star b)-\\Delta(a)\\star b-(-1)^p a\\star\\Delta(b)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall p,q,r\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall a\\in SH_p\\;\\forall b\\in SH_q\\;\\forall c\\in SH_r\\;\\bigl(\\beta(a,b\\star c)=\\beta(a,b)\\star c+(-1)^{(p+1)q}b\\star\\beta(a,c)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"-d","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"|0|","display":false}],"bytes":2847,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1235","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-string-topology.md|58-df-string-topology]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["ec1809e41ec24c81","0f3f51ff44894234","d9f6d19a1e737076"]}